# Cloudflare Pages response headers for every file of the SPA. The
# Content-Security-Policy that governs scripts is written into each page at
# generate time, with the hash of every inline script it carries (see
# frontend/app/build/csp.ts); a <meta> policy cannot say who may frame the page,
# so that part is here. Pages applies both, and a browser enforces each.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
